.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-AUTOSTART 1
.Os 1.6.2

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-autostart
.Nd configure applications and services started at login.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It lists the XDG autostart entries for the current user and lets each one be
enabled or disabled.
New entries can be added from an installed application, from an arbitrary
binary, or from a file, which is opened with
.Xr lumina-open 1
at login.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-autostart
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/autostart/
Per-user autostart entries, as defined by the XDG Autostart specification.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lumina-open 1

